BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_09fd443a-a40d-321a-bb95-b5d61ef2d3b5.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
